      "label": "Back Control",
      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "Most decisive position in Gi BJJ. Back exposure produced 38% of all subs at 2022 black-belt Worlds (43% of male black-belt subs in 2026); every athlete who scored back-control points at 2022 Worlds won. Seatbelt + chest-to-back connection first.",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-12T21:19:39.060Z"
        }
