      "notes": [
        {
          "text": "Stabilising option: chest-to-chest pressure passing was the 2nd-largest clearly identified elite pass category. Crossface + underhook, flatten their hips, free the knee, free the foot last.",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-12T21:19:39.060Z"
